action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# fresh-install
# launch-args: --debug
#
# P80 on iPad: each of the six `.cursor` shapes takes over its own label.
#
#   zsh testapp/test_ios.zsh P80 --device "iPad Pro 11-inch (M5)" --debug \
#       --actionfile testapp/actions/ios/P80-cursor-ipad.actions
#
# P72-cursor-ipad.actions showed `crosshair` only; this is the other five with it. Two things are
# read, as there: UIKitBackend's line under --debug when the system asks a view for a style
# ("-cursor: pointer style requested for <cursor>", in output/p80-ios-stdout.log), and the
# capture the runner takes while each hover row rests (screenshots/p80-ios-hover-L<line>-*.png).
# Pass: no request for the first row, which rests on plain text, then one for each of
# pointingHand, crosshair, text, resizeHorizontal, resizeVertical and notAllowed, in that order;
# each resting capture shows that row's shape at the point (UIKitBackend+Cursors.swift has the
# table: a highlight for the hand, a beam for text, drawn paths for the other four).
# The plain-text row comes first on purpose: the first hover of a run is captured before any
# style shows (2026-10-14: with hand first its capture equalled the unhovered one pixel for
# pixel; second, it showed the highlight).
# The labels are at y 181-203 on this iPad: hand x 109-156, cross 162-212, text 218-256,
# ↔ 262-287, ↕ 293-325, no 331-359 (from the tree, 2026-10-14).
#
# iPad 上的 P80:六種 `.cursor` 形狀各自在自己的標籤上生效。P72-cursor-ipad.actions 只看過 crosshair,這裡是它加上另外五種。
# 讀兩樣東西:--debug 下 UIKitBackend 印出的「-cursor: pointer style requested for <cursor>」(output/p80-ios-stdout.log),
# 以及 runner 在每一列 hover 停留時擷下的畫面。通過:第一列(停在一般文字上)沒有要求，接著 pointingHand、crosshair、text、
# resizeHorizontal、resizeVertical、notAllowed 依序各有一次;每張停留擷圖在該點顯示該列的形狀。
# 一般文字那一列放在最前面是有原因的:一次執行的第一個 hover 停留時，擷圖上還沒有樣式(2026-10-14:hand 排第一時擷圖與
# 沒有 hover 時逐像素相同，排第二時則看得到 highlight)。
sleep,,,,,,2500000,let P80 lay out,ios
hover,190,224,client,,,2000000,"plain text -- no request, the system pointer",ios
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,ios
hover,132,192,client,,,2000000,hand -- pointingHand: a highlight over the label,ios
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,ios
hover,187,192,client,,,2000000,cross -- crosshair: a drawn cross,ios
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,ios
hover,237,192,client,,,2000000,text -- a vertical beam,ios
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,ios
hover,274,192,client,,,2000000,resizeHorizontal -- a drawn left-right arrow,ios
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,ios
hover,309,192,client,,,2000000,resizeVertical -- a drawn up-down arrow,ios
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,ios
hover,345,192,client,,,2000000,notAllowed -- a drawn circle with a bar,ios
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,ios
